      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Isis no iba sola. Siete escorpiones, enviados por la diosa Serqet, caminaban con ella para protegerla.",
          "en": "Isis did not travel alone. Seven scorpions, sent by the goddess Serqet, walked with her to protect her."
        },
        {
          "es": "Dos la seguían, dos iban a sus lados y tres abrían el camino: Tefen y Befen, Mestet y Mestetef, Petet, Thetet y Matet.",
          "en": "Two followed, two walked at her sides, and three led the way: Tefen and Befen, Mestet and Mestetef, Petet, Thetet and Matet."
        },
        {
          "es": "Isis les dio una orden: «No hablen con nadie. No saluden a nadie. Que nadie sepa quiénes somos.»",
          "en": "Isis gave them an order: \"Speak to no one. Greet no one. Let nobody know who we are.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "Y así, bajo la luna, caminaron toda la noche por los senderos del delta.",
          "en": "And so, beneath the moon, they walked all night along the paths of the Delta."
        }
      ],
